      "id": "af39c52b92194d919bc6953ffe5f4924255217ef",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 699377499,
          "type": null,
          "body": "```\nFrame 304: 53 bytes on wire (424 bits), 53 bytes captured (424 bits) on interface virbr1, id 0\nEthernet II, Src: RealtekU_4f:32:2f (52:54:00:4f:32:2f), Dst: RealtekU_5b:1b:7b (52:54:00:5b:1b:7b)\nInternet Protocol Version 4, Src: 192.168.122.2, Dst: 192.168.122.1\nUser Datagram Protocol, Src Port: 3389, Dst Port: 44411\nUDP Remote Desktop Protocol\n    PacketPrefixByte: 0xe0\n    .... 0000 0000 1000 = Flags: 0x008\n    AckVec\n        Base sequence number: 0x0068\n        .... .... .000 0001 = Coded ackvec size: 1\n        1... .... = Have timestamp: True\n        Timestamp: 0x0133af\n        SendAckTimeGap: 0\n        Acks\n            bitmap !0068 !0069 006a 006b 006c !006d !006e\n                0... .... = Mode: Bitmap (0x0)\n```\n\nExclamation point means the packet has not been received.",
          "author": {
            "id": 5717614,
            "username": "hardening1",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "David Fort",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/5717614/avatar.png?v=1773998323",
